<title>USA: Ultramar Diamond Shamrock has Q4 net loss.</title>
<headline>Ultramar Diamond Shamrock has Q4 net loss.</headline>
<dateline>SAN ANTONIO 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Net shr loss    $1.61	  Profit  $0.38</p>
<p> Net loss	  118,900	Profit  29,200</p>
<p> Revs		2,720,200		2,070,400</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  74,674		   73,885</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Net shr loss    $0.54	  Profit  $1.61</p>
<p> Net loss	  35,900	 Profit  117,000</p>
<p> Revs		10,208,400	     8,083,500</p>
<p> Avg shrs	  74,427		   70,024</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Ultramar Diamond Shamrock Corp.</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 and full-year 1996 results hurt by a $77.4 million charge for merger costs; a $50.4 million charge to conform accounting practices of the merged firms; and $60.7 million to increase inventories to minimize tax payments.</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating net, before the charges, was $4.9 million or $0.05 per share for Q4, and $88.0 million or $1.11 per share for full-year 1996.</p>
</text>
